{"3589810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Caves of Combat", "steam_appid": 3589810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caves of Combat is a fast-paced, ability-driven action roguelike where every run challenges you to master chaotic combat, discover game-breaking synergies, and confront the ancient force lurking below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589810/extras/7a3870c4a7d414b597e1274c95deb37f.poster.avif?t=1763123367\" width=780 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589810/extras/7a3870c4a7d414b597e1274c95deb37f.webm?t=1763123367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589810/extras/7a3870c4a7d414b597e1274c95deb37f.mp4?t=1763123367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the surface lies a world twisted by time, filled with strange relics, hostile creatures, and a mysterious unrelenting force. You are not the first to descend — but you might be the last to survive. <br> <br>Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid, responsive melee combat</strong> – Strike, maneuver, and survive in high-stakes close-quarters action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stackable abilities with wild synergies</strong> – Combine and scale your powers to take down tougher foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging enemies and deadly boss fights</strong> – Face off against unique foes that test your skill and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> – Explore shifting, unpredictable layouts every time you descend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike structure</strong> – Permanent death, fast runs, and the drive to go further with each attempt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hostile, mysterious world</strong> – The caves hold secrets, danger, and something watching from the dark…</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caves of Combat is a fast-paced, ability-driven action roguelike where every run challenges you to master chaotic combat, discover game-breaking synergies, and confront the ancient force lurking below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589810/extras/7a3870c4a7d414b597e1274c95deb37f.poster.avif?t=1763123367\" width=780 height=130 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589810/extras/7a3870c4a7d414b597e1274c95deb37f.webm?t=1763123367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589810/extras/7a3870c4a7d414b597e1274c95deb37f.mp4?t=1763123367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the surface lies a world twisted by time, filled with strange relics, hostile creatures, and a mysterious unrelenting force. You are not the first to descend — but you might be the last to survive. <br> <br>Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid, responsive melee combat</strong> – Strike, maneuver, and survive in high-stakes close-quarters action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stackable abilities with wild synergies</strong> – Combine and scale your powers to take down tougher foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging enemies and deadly boss fights</strong> – Face off against unique foes that test your skill and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally generated levels</strong> – Explore shifting, unpredictable layouts every time you descend.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike structure</strong> – Permanent death, fast runs, and the drive to go further with each attempt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A hostile, mysterious world</strong> – The caves hold secrets, danger, and something watching from the dark…</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A melee-focused action roguelike with procedurally generated levels, ability synergies, and fast, skill-based combat.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589810/c8dbdfd3589794cf0965159af344a7de95d6b2f6/header.jpg?t=1763123367", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589810/5632e6f1b06adcab907ccfb290fec3e92e62078d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763123367", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589810/5632e6f1b06adcab907ccfb290fec3e92e62078d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763123367", "website": "https://cavesofcombat.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-2400 / AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 / AMD R9 270 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Intel Iris Plus / Apple M1 GPU or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS or SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-2400 / AMD FX-6300 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 / AMD R9 270 / Intel HD 4000 or equivalent (OpenGL 4.5 / Vulkan compatible)<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> OpenAL-compatible sound device</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Matt Burton"], "publishers": ["Matt Burton Games"], "demos": [{"appid": 3983680, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589810/f48a11894ef7675caf0c91afc6ef1719e71e7348/ss_f48a11894ef7675caf0c91afc6ef1719e71e7348.600x338.jpg?t=1763123367", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589810/f48a11894ef7675caf